{"seq":2,"slug":"git-lfs","title":"Git LFS 大文件存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/git-lfs","wordCount":827,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"git-lfs-大文件存储\">Git LFS 大文件存储</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要-git-lfs\">为什么需要 Git LFS</h2><p>Git 的设计基于文本差异比较和快照存储，对<strong>大型二进制文件（Large Binary Files）</strong> 的处理效率很低。每次修改一个 100MB 的文件，Git 都会存储一份完整副本，导致仓库体积急剧膨胀。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件类型</th>\n<th>典型大小</th>\n<th>适合 Git LFS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图片/图标</td>\n<td>KB-MB</td>\n<td>⚠️ 视数量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PSD/Sketch 设计稿</td>\n<td>10-500 MB</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频文件</td>\n<td>100MB-GB</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ML 模型</td>\n<td>MB-GB</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据集</td>\n<td>MB-GB</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译产物</td>\n<td>MB</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>不使用 LFS 时，大文件带来的问题不仅仅是磁盘占用：<code>git clone</code> 必须下载全部历史中的所有大文件版本，即使当前工作只需要最新版本。一个累积了多次大文件变更的仓库，clone 时间可能从几秒膨胀到数十分钟。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LFS 的思路是用一个轻量指针替换仓库中的大文件本体，核心概念都围绕这个替换机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指针文件</td>\n<td>Git 中记录大文件 oid 与大小的文本占位符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFS 服务器</td>\n<td>实际存放二进制内容的对象存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filter 驱动</td>\n<td>由 .gitattributes 触发的自动替换机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.gitattributes</td>\n<td>声明哪些路径交由 LFS 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>migrate</td>\n<td>把历史中已有的大文件迁入 LFS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>smudge</td>\n<td>checkout 时把指针还原为真实文件的步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"安装与配置\">安装与配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install git-lfs&#10;git lfs install&#10;&#10;git lfs version\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git-lfs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"追踪文件\">追踪文件</h2><p>使用 <code>git lfs track</code> 指定要通过 LFS 管理的文件模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git lfs track &quot;*.psd&quot;&#10;git lfs track &quot;*.zip&quot;&#10;git lfs track &quot;*.bin&quot;&#10;git lfs track &quot;datasets/**&quot;&#10;&#10;cat .gitattributes&#10;# *.psd filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text&#10;# *.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text&#10;&#10;git add .gitattributes&#10;git commit -m &quot;chore: configure Git LFS tracking&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.psd\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.zip\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.bin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"datasets/**\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitattributes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># *.psd filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># *.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitattributes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"chore: configure Git LFS tracking\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;git add large.psd&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;LFS filter&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;存储实际文件到 LFS 服务器&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;在 Git 中存储指针文件&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;仓库保持轻量&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"git add large.psd\"] --&gt; B[\"LFS filter\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"存储实际文件到 LFS 服务器\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"在 Git 中存储指针文件\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"仓库保持轻量\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>.gitattributes</code> 文件必须提交到仓库中，这样所有协作者才能自动使用 LFS。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git lfs track &quot;*.model&quot;&#10;git add .gitattributes&#10;git add models/bert.model&#10;git commit -m &quot;feat: add BERT model&quot;&#10;git push origin main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> track</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.model\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitattributes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> models/bert.model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"feat: add BERT model\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LFS 指针文件内容：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1&#10;oid sha256:4d7a214614ab2935c943f9e0ff69d22eadbb8f32b1258daaa5e2ca24d17e2393&#10;size 104857600\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">oid</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sha256:4d7a214614ab2935c943f9e0ff69d22eadbb8f32b1258daaa5e2ca24d17e2393</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 104857600</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查看追踪模式</td>\n<td><code>git lfs track</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查看 LFS 文件</td>\n<td><code>git lfs ls-files</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查看 LFS 状态</td>\n<td><code>git lfs status</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉取 LFS 文件</td>\n<td><code>git lfs pull</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>获取不下载</td>\n<td><code>git lfs fetch</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消追踪</td>\n<td><code>git lfs untrack &quot;*.psd&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"迁移已有文件\">迁移已有文件</h2><p>将仓库中已有的大文件迁移到 LFS：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git lfs migrate import --include=&quot;*.psd,*.zip&quot; --everything&#10;&#10;git lfs migrate import --include=&quot;*.bin&quot; --include-ref=main&#10;&#10;git lfs migrate info --everything\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --include=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.psd,*.zip\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --everything</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --include=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"*.bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --include-ref=main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> info</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --everything</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[现有仓库含大文件] --&gt; B[git lfs migrate import]&#10;    B --&gt; C[历史中大文件替换为指针]&#10;    C --&gt; D[大文件上传到 LFS 服务器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[git push --force]\">graph TD\n    A[现有仓库含大文件] --&gt; B[git lfs migrate import]\n    B --&gt; C[历史中大文件替换为指针]\n    C --&gt; D[大文件上传到 LFS 服务器]\n    D --&gt; E[git push --force]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>migrate import</code> 会重写 Git 历史，操作前务必备份仓库，操作后需要 force push 并通知所有协作者。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>迁移前可以使用 <code>git lfs migrate info</code> 分析仓库中哪些文件类型占用空间最多，帮助决定迁移范围：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git lfs migrate info --everything --top=10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> info</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --everything</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --top=10</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"存储与带宽\">存储与带宽</h2><p>GitHub 的 LFS 配额：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计划</th>\n<th>存储</th>\n<th>带宽/月</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Free</td>\n<td>1 GB</td>\n<td>1 GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pro</td>\n<td>2 GB</td>\n<td>2 GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Team</td>\n<td>4 GB</td>\n<td>8 GB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Packs</td>\n<td>50 GB</td>\n<td>50 GB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git lfs env&#10;&#10;git lfs prune&#10;git lfs prune --dry-run\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prune</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prune</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"lfs-与-ci-cd\">LFS 与 CI/CD</h2><p>CI 环境中需要注意 LFS 文件的下载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions&#10;- uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;  with:&#10;    lfs: true&#10;&#10;# 或手动拉取&#10;- uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;- run: git lfs pull\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    lfs:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或手动拉取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> uses:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">-</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span></span></code></pre></div><p>跳过 LFS 下载（不需要大文件的 CI 任务）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"GIT_LFS_SKIP_SMUDGE=1 git clone https://github.com/user/repo.git\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GIT_LFS_SKIP_SMUDGE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/user/repo.git</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CI 场景</th>\n<th>LFS 配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>需要大文件（构建）</td>\n<td><code>lfs: true</code> 或 <code>git lfs pull</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不需要（lint）</td>\n<td><code>GIT_LFS_SKIP_SMUDGE=1</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自建-lfs-服务器\">自建 LFS 服务器</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub LFS</td>\n<td>原生集成，有配额限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitLab LFS</td>\n<td>原生集成，自建无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MinIO + lfs-test-server</td>\n<td>开源方案，对象存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S3 + LakeFS</td>\n<td>大规模数据管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自建时需要实现 Git LFS 的 Batch API，处理 <code>upload</code> 和 <code>download</code> 两种操作。服务端返回临时签名 URL，客户端直接与对象存储交互完成文件传输。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Git LFS))&#10;    核心机制&#10;      指针文件&#10;      LFS 服务器&#10;      filter 驱动&#10;    操作&#10;      track / untrack&#10;      migrate import&#10;      pull / fetch&#10;    CI/CD&#10;      lfs: true&#10;      SKIP_SMUDGE&#10;    存储&#10;      GitHub 配额&#10;      自建服务器&#10;      prune 清理\">mindmap\n  root((Git LFS))\n    核心机制\n      指针文件\n      LFS 服务器\n      filter 驱动\n    操作\n      track / untrack\n      migrate import\n      pull / fetch\n    CI/CD\n      lfs: true\n      SKIP_SMUDGE\n    存储\n      GitHub 配额\n      自建服务器\n      prune 清理</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Git LFS</strong> 通过指针文件替换大型二进制文件，从根本上解决仓库膨胀问题</li>\n<li>使用 <code>git lfs track</code> 配置追踪模式，<code>.gitattributes</code> 文件必须纳入版本控制</li>\n<li><code>git lfs migrate import</code> 可以将已有大文件迁移到 LFS，但会<strong>重写历史</strong></li>\n<li>CI/CD 中按需配置 LFS 下载：需要大文件时启用，不需要时用 <code>SKIP_SMUDGE</code> 跳过</li>\n<li>关注 LFS 存储和带宽配额，大规模使用时考虑<strong>自建 LFS 服务器</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Git LFS 大文件存储","id":"git-lfs-大文件存储"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 Git LFS","id":"为什么需要-git-lfs"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"安装与配置","id":"安装与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪文件","id":"追踪文件"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移已有文件","id":"迁移已有文件"},{"level":2,"text":"存储与带宽","id":"存储与带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"LFS 与 CI/CD","id":"lfs-与-ci-cd"},{"level":2,"text":"自建 LFS 服务器","id":"自建-lfs-服务器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GitHub Actions 持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/github-actions"},"next":{"title":"签名与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/ecosystem/signing-and-security"}}